# 📤 Webhook Response

## Function
Sends final JSON response back to the calling application

## Configuration
**Response Type**: JSON  
**Response Body**: Complete formatted response  
**Error Handling**: Always responds, even on failures

## Response Modes
**Text Users**: Fast JSON response with text content  
**Voice Users**: JSON response with embedded audio data

## Frontend Integration
Response ready for immediate use:
```javascript
// Text display
displayMessage(response.response.message);

// Audio playback (voice users)
if (response.response.audio_url) {
  const audio = new Audio(response.response.audio_url);
  audio.play();
}

// Show call-to-action
showCTA(response.response.cta);
```

## Error Handling
Even on internal failures:
- Always returns valid JSON
- Includes error context
- Maintains user experience
- Logs issues for debugging

# 📤 Webhook Response Node

## Function
Sends final JSON response back to the website

## Node Configuration
**Type**: n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook
**Response Type**: JSON
**Response Body**: Complete formatted response
**Error Handling**: Always responds, even on failures

## Response Modes
**Text Users**: Fast JSON response with text content
**Voice Users**: JSON response with embedded base64 audio

## Frontend Integration
Response ready for immediate consumption:
```javascript
// Display text message
displayMessage(response.response.message);

// Play audio for voice users
if (response.response.audio_url) {
  const audio = new Audio(response.response.audio_url);
  audio.play();
}

// Show call-to-action
showCTA(response.response.cta);

// Update UI with metadata
updateSessionData(response.metadata);
```

## Error Handling
Even on internal workflow failures:
- Always returns valid JSON structure
- Includes error context and messages
- Maintains user experience continuity
- Logs issues for debugging and monitoring

## HTTP Status
- 200 OK for successful processing
- Structured error responses for failures

